(6661535, 996538, 30364, '<td valign="top">Took a while to reconcile, but that''s always a plus as far as I''m concerned.  Lovely tones and nice composition.  7 &amp; thank you.</td>', 'Took a while to reconcile, but that''s always a plus as far as I''m concerned.  Lovely tones and nice composition.  7 & thank you.', '2012-02-02 04:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6661536, 993627, 30364, '<td valign="top">A modern ''Behind the Gare Saint-Lazare''.  And it has quite the same symbolic relevance as well: a photograph of a decisive moment <i>in history</i>.  HCB with the emergence of the new European order of his time, you with the emergence of the new Western order (or disorder) of your time.  Ours.  Do I go too far?  Alas, I''m afraid I could have gone much further.  OK, it''s also very pretty.  The tones are beautiful.  7 &amp; thank you.</td>', 'A modern ''Behind the Gare Saint-Lazare''.  And it has quite the same symbolic relevance as well: a photograph of a decisive moment in history.  HCB with the emergence of the new European order of his time, you with the emergence of the new Western order (or disorder) of your time.  Ours.  Do I go too far?  Alas, I''m afraid I could have gone much further.  OK, it''s also very pretty.  The tones are beautiful.  7 & thank you.', '2012-02-02 04:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6661537, 996047, 30364, '<td valign="top">Can''t help grinning.  7 &amp; thank you.</td>', 'Can''t help grinning.  7 & thank you.', '2012-02-02 04:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
