(6661545, 996245, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting photograph.  Nice balance in the arrangement of the various elements.  "Validated Ticket Area'' and ''Video Monitoring'' are also splendid signs of the times.  And he reads a lurid tabloid in which a scantily clad blonde is said to be TKO''d.  Or maybe it is she who has TKO''d someone else (she does appear to be lap dancing in the picture).  This is a whole Chekhov play gathering in a single frame.  7 &amp; thank you.</td>', 'Interesting photograph.  Nice balance in the arrangement of the various elements.  "Validated Ticket Area'' and ''Video Monitoring'' are also splendid signs of the times.  And he reads a lurid tabloid in which a scantily clad blonde is said to be TKO''d.  Or maybe it is she who has TKO''d someone else (she does appear to be lap dancing in the picture).  This is a whole Chekhov play gathering in a single frame.  7 & thank you.', '2012-02-02 04:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6661546, 994487, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes.  No faces, no motivation, no emotion; unless we step <i>outside</i> of the frame with you.  I''m up for that!  7 &amp; thank you.</td>', 'Yes.  No faces, no motivation, no emotion; unless we step outside of the frame with you.  I''m up for that!  7 & thank you.', '2012-02-02 05:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
