(6661578, 995007, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a deceptively simple photograph.  It''s a prosaic scene made profound (well, more interesting) by the sweeping connection between the people and the ship.  And the effect is reinforced by the odd intrusion on the right: it seems to suggest a turning page, and says something about fleeting connections between people and places.  A clever and absorbing photograph, whether or not you entirely meant it as I saw it (and your title suggests that you did).  7 &amp; thank you.</td>', 'This is a deceptively simple photograph.  It''s a prosaic scene made profound (well, more interesting) by the sweeping connection between the people and the ship.  And the effect is reinforced by the odd intrusion on the right: it seems to suggest a turning page, and says something about fleeting connections between people and places.  A clever and absorbing photograph, whether or not you entirely meant it as I saw it (and your title suggests that you did).  7 & thank you.', '2012-02-02 05:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
