(6661803, 995143, 30364, '<td valign="top">I bend Floyd around my pictures, or my pictures around Floyd, quite a bit.  Yours is sure one I''d have been thrilled to do.  But I didn''t: you did, and you did a great job.  7 &amp; thank you.</td>', 'I bend Floyd around my pictures, or my pictures around Floyd, quite a bit.  Yours is sure one I''d have been thrilled to do.  But I didn''t: you did, and you did a great job.  7 & thank you.', '2012-02-02 09:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6661807, 996274, 30364, '<td valign="top">Vikings amok in the city!  With or without the horns, it''s a very interesting photograph.  I''d have cropped it square from near the top, maybe even from right AT the top (yep, right through the shadows), but it''s not my picture so WTF would I know?  7 &amp; thank you.</td>', 'Vikings amok in the city!  With or without the horns, it''s a very interesting photograph.  I''d have cropped it square from near the top, maybe even from right AT the top (yep, right through the shadows), but it''s not my picture so WTF would I know?  7 & thank you.', '2012-02-02 09:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6661810, 996481, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  7 &amp; thank you.</td>', 'Beautiful.  7 & thank you.', '2012-02-02 09:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6661812, 992896, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice uncertainty of scale.  Is it a Tempest?  Or a Storm in a Teacup?  All the better for not having an answer.  7 &amp; thank you.</td>', 'Nice uncertainty of scale.  Is it a Tempest?  Or a Storm in a Teacup?  All the better for not having an answer.  7 & thank you.', '2012-02-02 09:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
