(6662310, 995962, 108544, '<td valign="top">When shooting gulls, you really have to watch the exposure. Judging by the shot, your metering system exposed for the background. Leading to blown out highlights, on the extremely white bird. Check your histogram/photo review often. If you like more tips, don''t be shy. I''m a big bird shooter.</td>', 'When shooting gulls, you really have to watch the exposure. Judging by the shot, your metering system exposed for the background. Leading to blown out highlights, on the extremely white bird. Check your histogram/photo review often. If you like more tips, don''t be shy. I''m a big bird shooter.', '2012-02-02 19:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
