(6662766, 996388, 30364, '<td valign="top">Fascinating.  Great illustration of how to find beauty and interest in the most unpropitious of places.  Photographically, it''s fabulous  a meticulous drawing sketched with a camera.  10, thank you, and please accept an Order of the Thumb.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Fascinating.  Great illustration of how to find beauty and interest in the most unpropitious of places.  Photographically, it''s fabulous  a meticulous drawing sketched with a camera.  10, thank you, and please accept an Order of the Thumb.', '2012-02-03 05:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6662775, 996268, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beyond beautiful.  The best, loveliest botanical picture ever at DPC.  I usually don''t care if my own top choices are treated shabbily by the voters, but I truly hope that this one gets a high finish so that it is seen by as many people as possible, to show them how wonderful (<i>literally</i> wonderful) a picture of flowers can be!<br/>10 from me, and thank you, plus I will swap you your superfluous ''z'' for a bright &amp; shiny Order of the Thumb.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Beyond beautiful.  The best, loveliest botanical picture ever at DPC.  I usually don''t care if my own top choices are treated shabbily by the voters, but I truly hope that this one gets a high finish so that it is seen by as many people as possible, to show them how wonderful (literally wonderful) a picture of flowers can be!10 from me, and thank you, plus I will swap you your superfluous ''z'' for a bright & shiny Order of the Thumb.', '2012-02-03 05:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
