(6663958, 992501, 128201, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time convincing my mind that this is real. But there is no other way you could get every person on the beach to look up, and reflections on the underside of the plane match perfectly.<br/> <br/>Now I want to see the picture you took two seconds later that shows everyone being blown into the water from the jet exhaust.<br/> <br/>A great capture.</td>', 'I have a hard time convincing my mind that this is real. But there is no other way you could get every person on the beach to look up, and reflections on the underside of the plane match perfectly. Now I want to see the picture you took two seconds later that shows everyone being blown into the water from the jet exhaust. A great capture.', '2012-02-04 16:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
