(6664457, 995888, 94265, '<td valign="top">What a cute moment, such gorgeous animals. Lovely clear capture. I don''t think it needed the white borders, just personally. Black borders might have helped the black on their fur to pop. Great shot overall, best of luck with it.</td>', 'What a cute moment, such gorgeous animals. Lovely clear capture. I don''t think it needed the white borders, just personally. Black borders might have helped the black on their fur to pop. Great shot overall, best of luck with it.', '2012-02-05 11:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664459, 991720, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely scenery, it''s a nice vantage point here. The colours overall are gorgeous, a very good capture.</td>', 'Lovely scenery, it''s a nice vantage point here. The colours overall are gorgeous, a very good capture.', '2012-02-05 11:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
