(6664538, 996425, 101702, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get a lot of boring comments saying that the border ruins it. This is another I''m afraid. Because of the horizontal lines running through the shot I really think more of a letterbox format would emphasise this. I''d have been happier with a border about a quarter of the width of this. I like the dynamic range of the shot.</td>', 'You''ll probably get a lot of boring comments saying that the border ruins it. This is another I''m afraid. Because of the horizontal lines running through the shot I really think more of a letterbox format would emphasise this. I''d have been happier with a border about a quarter of the width of this. I like the dynamic range of the shot.', '2012-02-05 15:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
