(6664611, 996346, 83313, '<td valign="top">I guess you were afraid of it being guessed as mine? Not enough tonemapping to be mine, however. I''d edit it to show a bit more pore detail. I''ve certainly been entering a large number of cycling shots of late, but hey, it''s what I''ve been out doing. Thanks for the tip of the helmet. I haven''t photographed any cyclocross myself yet. I need to locate an event or two. <br/> <br/>BTW, the racing shot in this challenge isn''t mine either. I did photograph my entry while out riding, however.</td>', 'I guess you were afraid of it being guessed as mine? Not enough tonemapping to be mine, however. I''d edit it to show a bit more pore detail. I''ve certainly been entering a large number of cycling shots of late, but hey, it''s what I''ve been out doing. Thanks for the tip of the helmet. I haven''t photographed any cyclocross myself yet. I need to locate an event or two.  BTW, the racing shot in this challenge isn''t mine either. I did photograph my entry while out riding, however.', '2012-02-05 19:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
