(6666533, 995996, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. This is a very difficult capture to execute well.</td>', 'Nice shot. This is a very difficult capture to execute well.', '2012-02-07 20:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6666535, 996484, 14476, '<td valign="top">While I wish you had the pixels to blow this up a bit more, it''s a<br/>grand find.  I love to find wildlife on signs that to them are <br/>without meaning, but to "us" are so very important...and I see you<br/>do as well.<br/>:)</td>', 'While I wish you had the pixels to blow this up a bit more, it''s agrand find.  I love to find wildlife on signs that to them are without meaning, but to "us" are so very important...and I see youdo as well.:)', '2012-02-07 20:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6666536, 996256, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, goood abstract.  And good seeing to find it.</td>', 'Oh, goood abstract.  And good seeing to find it.', '2012-02-07 20:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6666537, 994624, 40391, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image!  I really love this.  Very well processed but its the perspective and timing that makes this shot work so well. 10.</td>', 'Fantastic image!  I really love this.  Very well processed but its the perspective and timing that makes this shot work so well. 10.', '2012-02-07 20:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6666538, 996427, 14476, '<td valign="top">This image is so contradictory that it is amazingly good.<br/>the background bridge/wires.<br/>The foreground markers, the ridges inbetween,<br/>the hillocks, the snow.<br/>I want to know all about this image when the Challenge ends!<br/>yes, I do.<br/>10</td>', 'This image is so contradictory that it is amazingly good.the background bridge/wires.The foreground markers, the ridges inbetween,the hillocks, the snow.I want to know all about this image when the Challenge ends!yes, I do.10', '2012-02-07 20:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6666539, 995228, 40391, '<td valign="top">Looks like hes had a lot to Bear in his life.  Great portrait!</td>', 'Looks like hes had a lot to Bear in his life.  Great portrait!', '2012-02-07 20:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6666540, 995995, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely  "S" curve with the path and the beach.  Beautiful lighting,<br/>at either sunrise or sunset.  That horizon.  Undoubtedly you are perfectly<br/>correct in the way it is framed, but it does ''read'' downhill.  Maybe just a slight uphill adjustment would make this even more impressive.</td>', 'Lovely  "S" curve with the path and the beach.  Beautiful lighting,at either sunrise or sunset.  That horizon.  Undoubtedly you are perfectlycorrect in the way it is framed, but it does ''read'' downhill.  Maybe just a slight uphill adjustment would make this even more impressive.', '2012-02-07 20:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6666541, 995785, 46918, '<td valign="top">Sad end to prob a nice boat...I love the sky...Honestly, I think that you could have either done a long shutter and had the water look like it was flowing...or do a faster shutter and completely stop the motion. Still a good shot</td>', 'Sad end to prob a nice boat...I love the sky...Honestly, I think that you could have either done a long shutter and had the water look like it was flowing...or do a faster shutter and completely stop the motion. Still a good shot', '2012-02-07 20:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
