(6666591, 993492, 50695, '<td valign="top">gorgeous, frightening, all that. I''m afraid I''ll be neglecting you a bit with my ribbons. You''ve reached a new stage, at least in my appreciation of you. The same thing happened to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=32997" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bucket</a>. I''m seeing your work holistically (when I recognize it) and no longer am able to judge individual pieces compared to others.</td>', 'gorgeous, frightening, all that. I''m afraid I''ll be neglecting you a bit with my ribbons. You''ve reached a new stage, at least in my appreciation of you. The same thing happened to  bucket. I''m seeing your work holistically (when I recognize it) and no longer am able to judge individual pieces compared to others.', '2012-02-07 20:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
