(6666899, 994654, 108580, '<td valign="top">OMW! That is simply wonderful work for a 400D and a f/4-5.6 lens. Go girl! I also started with basic gear at my schools newspaper. Keep it up, you''ll go far. I''m fave''ing it.</td>', 'OMW! That is simply wonderful work for a 400D and a f/4-5.6 lens. Go girl! I also started with basic gear at my schools newspaper. Keep it up, you''ll go far. I''m fave''ing it.', '2012-02-08 01:41:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6666900, 995838, 113591, '<td valign="top">What a good image, Harvey! The light is wonderful. Thanks.</td>', 'What a good image, Harvey! The light is wonderful. Thanks.', '2012-02-08 01:41:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6666901, 995164, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great result for a FS Alex. I gave it a 7. Great smoothness, "smoke" in the rocks and minimalist island in the distance. I think the sky could have done more though, especially in PP.</td>', 'Great result for a FS Alex. I gave it a 7. Great smoothness, "smoke" in the rocks and minimalist island in the distance. I think the sky could have done more though, especially in PP.', '2012-02-08 01:46:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6666906, 996171, 108580, '<td valign="top">I know you can''t DO anything about the POV if he''s on a 10" pole :) It''s just an observation and I have the same dilemma as you did when submitting. Show the pole or don''t show it and take a beating from the "It''s a bird park shot" if showing a portrait only. 7 from me :)</td>', 'I know you can''t DO anything about the POV if he''s on a 10" pole :) It''s just an observation and I have the same dilemma as you did when submitting. Show the pole or don''t show it and take a beating from the "It''s a bird park shot" if showing a portrait only. 7 from me :)', '2012-02-08 01:49:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6666907, 996471, 108580, '<td valign="top">What do I know about MA :) 7.</td>', 'What do I know about MA :) 7.', '2012-02-08 01:50:28.000000', NULL, 0),
