(6667039, 991343, 20799, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. What a breathtaking, huge lenticularis!<br/>Your stunning landscapes from the Rockies have been inspiring me for years. This one... what a gem. I''m glad it has been seen and appreciated by so many people and I''m sure it will gain even more popularity (where is National Geographic?). Congrats on the ribbon, so well deserved!</td>', 'Fantastic. What a breathtaking, huge lenticularis!Your stunning landscapes from the Rockies have been inspiring me for years. This one... what a gem. I''m glad it has been seen and appreciated by so many people and I''m sure it will gain even more popularity (where is National Geographic?). Congrats on the ribbon, so well deserved!', '2012-02-08 04:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
