(6667422, 996472, 108580, '<td valign="top">Reminds me so much of the typical 60''s and 70''s Suburbia in SA especially the wire garden chairs :)<br/>Some days I wish we could go back to sitting outside without guard dogs, armed response and razor wire...<br/>Calling it "stormy" hurt it. No angry clouds or torrential rain to speak of.<br/>I like the shot and the conversion Gina, albeit it a tad dark, which no doubt was the intention.<br/>Is this home? Beautiful house, setting and garden.</td>', 'Reminds me so much of the typical 60''s and 70''s Suburbia in SA especially the wire garden chairs :)Some days I wish we could go back to sitting outside without guard dogs, armed response and razor wire...Calling it "stormy" hurt it. No angry clouds or torrential rain to speak of.I like the shot and the conversion Gina, albeit it a tad dark, which no doubt was the intention.Is this home? Beautiful house, setting and garden.', '2012-02-08 13:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
