(6699132, 994187, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey Bob - I meant to drop in and say how much I like this photo.  My apologies for the delay.  Fantastic detail in this shot!  Certainly some opportunities up your way that are fun to photograph.  We get up there once a year for summer vacation and I''ve seen some old trains but nothing like what you''ve captured here.<br/> <br/>They do have a train that''s operational at Clark''s Trading Post.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=852993" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30049/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_852993.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30049/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_852993.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30049/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_852993.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Are there any others that are active in the summer that you know about?<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hey Bob - I meant to drop in and say how much I like this photo.  My apologies for the delay.  Fantastic detail in this shot!  Certainly some opportunities up your way that are fun to photograph.  We get up there once a year for summer vacation and I''ve seen some old trains but nothing like what you''ve captured here. They do have a train that''s operational at Clark''s Trading Post.   Are there any others that are active in the summer that you know about? ', '2012-03-03 11:12:34.000000', NULL, 0),
