(6799633, 996092, 69008, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great image of this medium sized gator critter! <br/>Big congrats on your ribbon in the Orange (County) Audubon Society photo contest too.  <br/>You really nailed this shot. <br/>It''s like the crisp and sharp evil twin to my "Swamp Evil" blur image.  Interestingly, we were doing a DPC GTG in Ft Myers when I shot it. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=842003" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/69008/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_842003.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/69008/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_842003.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/69008/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_842003.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Wow, what a great image of this medium sized gator critter! Big congrats on your ribbon in the Orange (County) Audubon Society photo contest too.  You really nailed this shot. It''s like the crisp and sharp evil twin to my "Swamp Evil" blur image.  Interestingly, we were doing a DPC GTG in Ft Myers when I shot it. ', '2012-06-22 00:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
