(6918139, 991343, 67697, '<td valign="top">The title seems so appropriate for a challenge in December.  Let''s hope you are not a good prognosticator :)  I know you went through a lot this year so I hope that 2012 ends on a positive note for you and your family.<br/> <br/>Beautiful scene - that cloud is so fascinating.  I''ve never seen anything like it.</td>', 'The title seems so appropriate for a challenge in December.  Let''s hope you are not a good prognosticator :)  I know you went through a lot this year so I hope that 2012 ends on a positive note for you and your family. Beautiful scene - that cloud is so fascinating.  I''ve never seen anything like it.', '2012-12-01 12:13:19.000000', NULL, 0),
